{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558881485,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf551e3ffe3ZNaVzqVUnVWuj","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40b6c4e001yzLAkV5AroD1DF","sessionID":"ses_e2bf551e3ffe3ZNaVzqVUnVWuj","messageID":"msg_1d40b559b001SQ8y5cvBVFuI0z","type":"tool","id":"call_b92cfeffb4064e88a73fc54b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"hook health\" .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml | cat","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml:59:    - \"Leg advisor: run node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root \\\"$PWD\\\" --format json --timeout-ms 500 --warm-only. Exit 0 with data.freshness set to live is PASS. Exit 0 with any other freshness is DEGRADED, with repair /doctor:skill-advisor rebuild. Exit 75 with a staleDistWarning field in stderr JSON is FAIL, with repair npm --prefix .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime run build. Exit 75 without that field is SKIP because the daemon is not running. Any other exit is FAIL, with repair /doctor:skill-advisor rebuild. When data.hookHealth is present, show hook p95 <rollingP95Ms> ms over <invocations> prompts and fail-open <rollingFailOpenRate as a percent> under the leg. It never changes the leg's status. When data.hookHealth is absent, show hook health not recorded: the prompt hook writes its health records only when SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG is set. It never changes the leg's status.\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml:59:    - \"Leg advisor: run node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root \\\"$PWD\\\" --format json --timeout-ms 500 --warm-only. Exit 0 with data.freshness set to live is PASS. Exit 0 with any other freshness is DEGRADED, with repair /doctor:skill-advisor rebuild. Exit 75 with a staleDistWarning field in stderr JSON is FAIL, with repair npm --prefix .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime run build. Exit 75 without that field is SKIP because the daemon is not running. Any other exit is FAIL, with repair /doctor:skill-advisor rebuild. When data.hookHealth is present, show hook p95 <rollingP95Ms> ms over <invocations> prompts and fail-open <rollingFailOpenRate as a percent> under the leg. It never changes the leg's status. When data.hookHealth is absent, show hook health not recorded: the prompt hook writes its health records only when SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG is set. It never changes the leg's status.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"hook health\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml | cat\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558880846,"end":1794558881485}}}}
