{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558892641,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf551e3ffe3ZNaVzqVUnVWuj","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40b9592001SJshktIy3F3eng","sessionID":"ses_e2bf551e3ffe3ZNaVzqVUnVWuj","messageID":"msg_1d40b7362001TKFHwl1KHWxt6c","type":"tool","id":"call_f8eda4d3d78f46dca00ea43d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"[A-Z][A-Z_]{4,}\" .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md | cat; echo \"--- presentation ---\"; rg -n \"hook health|SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md | cat","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"12:## 1. ROUTER CONTRACT\n20:## 2. OWNED ASSETS\n30:## 3. MODE ROUTING\n33:- `execution_mode` is always `INTERACTIVE`.\n41:## 4. EXECUTION TARGETS\n53:## 5. PRESENTATION BOUNDARY\n59:## 6. WORKFLOW SUMMARY\n63:The delivery leg reports DEGRADED, never FAIL, when a prompt hook is missing or the Codex hook is unapproved, and names the repair.\n78:It reports DEGRADED when exit 0 has any other freshness value and names `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\n--- presentation ---\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"12:## 1. ROUTER CONTRACT\n20:## 2. OWNED ASSETS\n30:## 3. MODE ROUTING\n33:- `execution_mode` is always `INTERACTIVE`.\n41:## 4. EXECUTION TARGETS\n53:## 5. PRESENTATION BOUNDARY\n59:## 6. WORKFLOW SUMMARY\n63:The delivery leg reports DEGRADED, never FAIL, when a prompt hook is missing or the Codex hook is unapproved, and names the repair.\n78:It reports DEGRADED when exit 0 has any other freshness value and names `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\n--- presentation ---\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"[A-Z][A-Z_]{4,}\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md | cat; echo \\\"--- presentation ---\\\"; rg -n \\\"hook health|SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md | cat\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558891410,"end":1794558892641}}}}
