{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558940269,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf551e3ffe3ZNaVzqVUnVWuj","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40c5065001XnAvH59J6u08hE","sessionID":"ses_e2bf551e3ffe3ZNaVzqVUnVWuj","messageID":"msg_1d40c176c001TzcD0Cy7Ar3lOs","type":"tool","id":"call_e4a6f71312c14a9883830ec2","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md","oldString":"It reports FAIL for any other exit with `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.","newString":"It reports FAIL for any other exit with `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\nWhen the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on."},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\n@@ -78,4 +78,5 @@\n It reports DEGRADED when exit 0 has any other freshness value and names `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\n It reports FAIL when exit 75 includes `staleDistWarning` in stderr JSON and names `npm --prefix .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime run build`.\n It reports SKIP when exit 75 lacks that field because the daemon is stopped.\n It reports FAIL for any other exit with `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\n+When the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on.\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\",\"oldString\":\"It reports FAIL for any other exit with `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\",\"newString\":\"It reports FAIL for any other exit with `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild`.\\nWhen the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558939237,"end":1794558940269}}}}
